# On-card AirPlay helper (linux/gcast/ffmpeg and linux/gcast/ffprobe)

This program is separate from the LGPL libav linked into bin/misterplexd.
ffmpeg links libx264. ffprobe is the same FFmpeg 8.1.2 and OpenSSL 3.0.15,
with the same decoders, demuxers, and protocols, and without libx264:
probe does not encode.

The complete corresponding source for this helper is attached as assets to
the MisterPlex rc5 release:
https://github.com/flynnsbit/misterplex-cast/releases/tag/rc5
It is available on request from the distributor. On request we will provide
the same source on a physical medium for three years from this release, for
no more than the cost of distribution.
GPL-2.0 text: licenses/rbf/GPL-2.

